<title>THAILAND: MBK Property June 30 year net rises.</title>
<headline>MBK Property June 30 year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for the year ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	    2.40	     vs	 1.62</p>
<p>    Net profit	   373.14	    vs	236.97</p>
<p>Note: Revenue not stated. Company's full name is MBK Property and Development Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
